<title>UK: Centrica active as U.S. holdings auctioned.</title>
<headline>Centrica active as U.S. holdings auctioned.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Centrica Plc, created in the British Gas Plc demerger which took effect earlier this week, were heavily traded on Thursday ahead of an auction of shares held by U.S. investors, dealers said.</p>
</text>
